Package: litportFreeProxy
Title: Client for the Litport Free Proxy Snapshot API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Litport", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@litport.net")
Description: Fetches and validates snapshots of verified HTTP, SOCKS4, and
    SOCKS5 proxies from the Litport free proxy API. Filters results by
    protocol, country, anonymity, HTTPS support, latency, uptime, and
    freshness, returning a normalized data frame. Validation rejects
    private and reserved IPv4 ranges, malformed timestamps, and truncated
    or stale snapshots.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://litport.net/free-proxy, https://litport.net/docs/free-proxy-api,
    https://github.com/litportnet/free-proxy-sdk
BugReports: https://github.com/litportnet/free-proxy-sdk/issues
Imports: curl, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
